WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.700
Each book answers one question
in depth, in reading order.

2
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:07.723
But an engineer, an ISSO or an
authorizing official usually

3
00:00:07.723 --> 00:00:11.663
arrives with a question that
cuts across all twenty books.

4
00:00:11.663 --> 00:00:16.187
The Reference tab exists for those
questions, and they fall into three kinds.

5
00:00:16.187 --> 00:00:20.438
Run it: which command does the
job, and which chapter teaches it.

6
00:00:20.438 --> 00:00:23.965
Prove it: which federal requirement
a piece of work supports,

7
00:00:23.965 --> 00:00:26.363
and what evidence an assessor would read.

8
00:00:26.363 --> 00:00:30.251
Trust it: whether the sources behind
all of this are still current.

9
00:00:30.251 --> 00:00:33.290
Every page on the tab
answers one of those three.
